  "description": "YITAMOTOR special design, same as original equipment in fit, performance, and function. You can get this Factory style headlight from YITAMOTOR for much less.\nFitment\n1999-2002 Chevy Silverado 1500 / 2500 / 3500\n2001-2002 Chevy Silverado 1500HD / 2500HD\n2000-2006 Chevy Suburban 1500 / 2500\n2000-2006 Chevy Tahoe (NOT FIT 2000 Chevrolet Tahoe Z71 Model)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: Headlight assembly compatible with 1999 2000 2001 2002 Chevy Silverado 1500/2500; 2001 2002 Chevy Silverado 1500HD, 2500HD, 3500; 2000 2001 2002 2003 2004 2005 2006 Chevy Suburban; and 2000 2001 2002 2003 2004 2005 2006 Chevy Tahoe (does not fit 2000 Tahoe Z71 model). Not compatible with GMC Sierra. High beam mode: HB3/9005; low beam mode: HB4/9006. Note: Bulbs and wiring harness are NOT included\nImpact-Resistant & Tough: Constructed with durable polycarbonate lenses that give great protection against the abuse of road debris & impact from branches on the trail, and the high-impact housing also better withstands shock and vibration for your off-road adventures\nWaterproof: The fully sealed structure with solid silicon prevents moisture from being trapped inside the housing & provides reliable service in sorts of weather conditions such as rain, snow or dust storms\nSide Safety Reflector: Built-in micro-prism reflectors on the sides make your vehicle highly visible to oncoming traffic and pedestrians at night. This passive safety feature ensures you are seen from all angles, reducing collision risks\nDirect Replacement: Professional Installation would be highly recommended; come as a pair, including Driver (Left) & Passenger (Right) side",
